                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG, VERFAHREN UND SOFTWARE ZUR UNTERSTÜTZUNG EINES BEDIENERS BEIM FLIEGEN EINER DROHNE UNTER VERWENDUNG EINER FERNBEDIENUNG UND AR BRILLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL, PROCÉDÉ ET LOGICIEL POUR AIDER UN OPÉRATEUR À PILOTER UN DRONE AÉRIEN À L'AIDE D'UNE COMMANDE À DISTANCE ET DE LUNETTES À RÉALITÉ AUGMENTÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS, METHOD AND SOFTWARE FOR ASSISTING AN OPERATOR IN FLYING A DRONE USING A REMOTE CONTROLLER AND AR GLASSES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Apparatus (100), method, and software for assisting human operator (120) in flying drone (160) using remote controller (150). The apparatus (100) includes an internal data communication interface (108) configured to receive data from the remote controller (150), an augmented reality display (112) configured to display the data, one or more memories (104) including computer program code (106), and one or more processors (102) to cause the apparatus (100) to: superimpose, on the augmented reality display (112), a target symbol (200) indicating a position of the drone (160) while the human operator (120) is looking (204) towards the drone (160); and superimpose, on the augmented reality display (112), an orientation symbol (202) indicating an orientation of the drone (160) while the human operator (120) is looking (204) towards the drone (160).</p>
            </abstract>
